WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.643
This table shows why storage alone is not enough ZIP
codes may look

00:00:05.669 --> 00:00:11.290
numeric but arithmetic on them is meaningless
Satisfaction ratings use numbers

00:00:11.316 --> 00:00:17.685
but represent ordered categories Emergency visits
are true counts Celsius

00:00:17.711 --> 00:00:23.575
temperature is a numeric measurement but its zero
point is arbitrary When

00:00:23.588 --> 00:00:27.970
you see a numeric-looking column first ask what the
numbers mean in the real world

00:00:29.707 --> 00:00:33.391
Only after that should you choose summaries
encodings or models
